/target
# HFTASK-0035 (ADR-0004 §3.3/§6 rev): the local ledger is gitignored (legitimate per-repo
# source of record, never committed). `**` also covers the top-level path + grit worktrees.
.handoff/**/ledger.db
.handoff/**/*.db-wal
.handoff/**/*.db-shm
/.handoff/packets/

.grit
/_workspace/
/_workspace_prev/

# HFTASK-0037: active.md is a derived view (hf renders it); like packets/, never committed.
/.handoff/active.md

# HFTASK-0048: the on-disk lock mirror is ephemeral advisory state (the ledger is
# authoritative); like the ledger.db, it is never committed.
/.handoff/locks/
